{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continue exploring the mystical islands beyond the Coral Sea ! \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Progress the story where you left off. Will you come closer to solving the mysteries of the protagonist 's past? \u00a0 What happened to the people at the shipwreck? And is there an even older story to discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game requires room scale interactions and a play area of at least 2x2 m.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finishing the game takes around 30 minutes to 2 hours depending on how you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We recommend taking your time, playing the game without stress in a calm environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you like it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features include: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice acted story, Immersive environment, Beautiful soundtrack by film score composer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722560?t=1747165511","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722560?t=1747165511","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722560/ea8bb966a9b67ba0c3c6067075beb153124c6aa5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747165511","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722560/ea8bb966a9b67ba0c3c6067075beb153124c6aa5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747165511","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Alcohol, Tobacco and Psychedelic mushrooms."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continue expl